  "title": "fix(windows): 持久登记启动根并显式恢复不可写的新安装",
  "user": {
    "login": "gzers",
    "id": 22311504,
    "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzExNTA0",
    "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/22311504?v=4",
